    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Endless Furry Ping-Pong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 7th installment of the &quot;Endless Furry&quot; Series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a simple parody game, but with a furry twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Single Player vs AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Two Player PvP Local Splitscreen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Partial Controller Support In Both Single And Two Player Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Get Addicted To Furry Culture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Steam Leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6. Steam Achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7. Earn Steam Inventory Items by playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590030/extras/8d55933d486b4c38b7f7562601a20e65.avif?t=1754658748\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Endless Furry Ping-Pong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 7th installment of the &quot;Endless Furry&quot; Series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a simple parody game, but with a furry twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Single Player vs AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Two Player PvP Local Splitscreen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Partial Controller Support In Both Single And Two Player Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Get Addicted To Furry Culture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Steam Leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6. Steam Achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7. Earn Steam Inventory Items by playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590030/extras/8d55933d486b4c38b7f7562601a20e65.avif?t=1754658748\" /></div></p>",
